<title>MALTA: PRESS DIGEST - Malta - May 13.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Malta - May 13.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the leading stories in the Maltese press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THE TIMES</p>
<p>- Magistrate throws out Libyan extradition request.</p>
<p>IN-NAZZJON</p>
<p>- Parliament approves procedural motion.</p>
<p>L-ORIZZONT</p>
<p>- Romanian sailors still on hunger strike.</p>
</text>
